    <!-- UPDATE DATE / VERSION WITH ANY UPDATES -->
    <p>Sticky Tab Component is nested within an ISGStickyTabSet. The title must be filled up in this component as
      well as the body with the desired content.
      The ISGStickyTabset will then calculate the correct offset and selection of the floating navigation
    </p>

